        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "两位反对者倾向于在本次会议上维持联邦基金利率目标区间在2-1/4至2-1/2 percent不变，即反对降息。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
